WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:06.620
Did you know that roughly 70% of kerbside
rubbish is either recyclable or compostable?

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.660
If we use our bins properly, we can make a huge difference

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.080
to the amount of stuff going to landfill.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:20.940
But that’s just the start, we also need
to rethink rubbish – by using the 3 R’s

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.980
Reduce – by refusing to purchase products
that are not sustainable,

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.420
have unnecessary packaging or we just don’t need.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.520
Reuse – By repairing, repurposing or re-gifting.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:37.360
And lastly, recycling items that can’t
be reduced or reused.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:44.860
Learn more at waimakariri.govt.nz/rethinkrubbish

